{
  "info": {
    "name": "FIX_DUP_ALLOC_1001 - DB resend (2 CTKM)",
    "description": "Xoa dong phan bo TRUNG Idx 1001 tren SAP.\n\nEPS260800230 / dong KM 0423 / alloc 1001\nEPS2609009   / dong KM 0017 / alloc 1001\n\nDIEU KIEN: phai chay 16_fix_data_2line.sql va COMMIT TRUOC (Idx 1001 -> IsDeleted=true).\nChua COMMIT thi request dau se fail assert va tu dung, khong goi CTKM thu 2.\n\nBao SAP truoc khi chay.\n\nLUU Y: C1 chua deploy -> dan khach KHONG mo/Luu 2 CTKM nay, ReorderAllocatePAIdx se danh lai 1000/1002 -> 1/2.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "EPS260800230 (dong KM 0423 / alloc 1001)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "const req = r.requestData || '';",
              "",
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('isSuccess = true', () => pm.expect(r.isSuccess).to.eql(true));",
              "",
              "const nDel = (req.match(/<Deleted>true<\\/Deleted>\\s*<\\/BUDGET_ALLOC>/g) || []).length;",
              "const has1001 = /<AllocationCode>1001<\\/AllocationCode>[\\s\\S]*?<Deleted>true<\\/Deleted>/.test(req);",
              "const hasOther = /<AllocationCode>(1000|1002)<\\/AllocationCode>/.test(req);",
              "",
              "console.log(pm.info.requestName, 'isSuccess=', r.isSuccess, 'value=', r.value,",
              "            'budgetDeleted=', nDel, '1001_deleted=', has1001, 'co1000_1002=', hasOther, r.message);",
              "",
              "// Phai co dung ma 1001 kem Deleted=true -> DB da UPDATE va COMMIT",
              "pm.test('Co AllocationCode 1001 voi Deleted=true', () => pm.expect(has1001).to.eql(true));",
              "",
              "// Action DB chi gui dong IsDeleted=true -> KHONG duoc co 1000/1002",
              "pm.test('Khong dung den 1000/1002', () => pm.expect(hasOther).to.eql(false));",
              "",
              "// Chot chan: sai thi dung, khong goi CTKM tiep theo",
              "if (!has1001 || hasOther || r.isSuccess !== true) {",
              "    console.error('DUNG:', pm.info.requestName, '-> kiem tra lai buoc UPDATE (16_fix_data_2line.sql) da COMMIT chua.');",
              "    postman.setNextRequest(null);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"targetObj\": \"promotion\", \"action\": \"DB\", \"data\": \"3a2382f4-789c-1c5f-0888-28ce0d803e11\"}",
          "options": {
